          "from": "τον πατέρα /ton paˈtera/ 'the father (acc.)'",
          "to": "[tombaˈtera] ~ [tobaˈtera]",
          "note": "/n/ assimilates in place to the following stop (which becomes voiced) or is deleted, depending on dialect and tempo."
        }
      ]
